---
import { Picture } from 'astro:assets';
import heroPhoto from '~/assets/photos/hero-jump.avif';
---

<section
  class="relative isolate flex min-h-[640px] flex-col overflow-hidden bg-night text-line sm:min-h-[720px] lg:h-svh lg:max-h-[880px]"
>
  <Picture
    src={heroPhoto}
    alt="Young players and coaches leap into the air with rackets raised on a blue tennis court."
    formats={['avif', 'webp']}
    widths={[640, 960, 1280, 1800]}
    sizes="100vw"
    loading="eager"
    fetchpriority="high"
    class="absolute inset-0 -z-20 size-full object-cover object-[58%_50%]"
  />
  {/* Navy wash: darkest behind the headline (top left) and the details (bottom), clear over the kids. */}
  <div
    aria-hidden="true"
    class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 bg-night/45 bg-[linear-gradient(to_bottom,rgb(20_41_74/0.8),transparent_35%,transparent_55%,rgb(20_41_74/0.9)),linear-gradient(to_right,rgb(20_41_74/0.75),transparent_60%)] lg:bg-night/0"
  >
  </div>

  <div class="mx-auto flex w-full max-w-6xl flex-1 flex-col justify-between gap-16 px-4 pt-32 pb-10 sm:px-6 sm:pt-36 lg:pb-12">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <h1
        class="font-display text-[3.25rem] leading-[0.92] font-extrabold tracking-tight uppercase [font-stretch:72%] sm:text-7xl lg:text-[5.5rem]"
      >
        At Kiest, tennis belongs to <span class="whitespace-nowrap text-ball">every kid.</span>
      </h1>

      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-7 gap-y-4">
        <a
          href="/take-action"
          class="rounded-full bg-ball px-7 py-3.5 font-bold tracking-wide text-night uppercase [font-stretch:85%] shadow-lg shadow-black/25 transition hover:bg-[#e6f56b]"
        >
          Speak up for Kiest kids
        </a>
        <a
          href="#where-things-stand"
          class="font-semibold text-line underline decoration-ball decoration-2 underline-offset-6 hover:decoration-line"
        >
          See where things stand
        </a>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-line/80">
        The city now expects the new contract this winter. There’s still time to be heard.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 lg:flex-row lg:items-end lg:justify-between">
      <p class="max-w-xl font-serif text-lg leading-relaxed text-line/90">
        For decades, Kiest Tennis Center has been home to tennis in Oak Cliff and South Dallas. Today,
        through the Dallas Tennis Association, more than 1,000 kids a year, from the neighborhood and across
        the city, learn and play here for free. Whoever runs the center next, we’re staying.
      </p>

      <p
        class="flex w-fit shrink-0 items-center gap-3 rounded-full bg-night/60 py-2 pr-5 pl-2 ring-1 ring-line/20 backdrop-blur-sm"
      >
        <span class="grid size-10 place-items-center rounded-full bg-ball font-extrabold text-night">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="size-6" aria-hidden="true">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" />
            <path d="M4 6.5c4 2 4 9 0 11M20 6.5c-4 2-4 9 0 11" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" />
          </svg>
        </span>
        <span class="leading-tight">
          <span class="block text-xl font-extrabold [font-stretch:80%]">1,000+</span>
          <span class="text-sm text-line/85">kids a year, free</span>
        </span>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
